content.text:
Confirmed:
- **Realme C25** (RMX3191/RMX3193): MediaTek Helio G70 / MT6769V (or MT6768V/CA) → **Mali-G52 2EEMC2** @820MHz → Mali driver (malisx2). Weak GPU → 540p. Display 720x1600 → the internal render height should be 720 at most (native panel is 720p!). Actually the panel is 720x1600, so rendering at 1080p would be downscaled — 540p is right for this weak GPU.
- **Samsung Galaxy A9 2018** (SM-A920F): Snapdragon 660 (SDM660) → **Adreno 512** @896MHz → Turnip driver. Mid GPU → 720p.

Important: Build.SOC_MANUFACTURER for these:
- Realme C25: "mt6769" or "MT6769" / "mt6768"
- Galaxy A9 2018: "qcom" / "Qualcomm Snapdragon 660" → Build.SOC_MODEL = "SDM660", SOC_MANUFACTURER = "Qualcomm", SOC_BRAND = "qcom".

So I should match on:
- Adreno: soc contains "sdm660", "660", "msm", "sdm6", "sm6" → 720p for Adreno 5xx; "sdm8", "845", "855", "865", "730", "732", "740", "835", "860", "870", "888" → 1080p.
- Mali: MediaTek codes: mt6769 (Helio G70/G81 → G52), mt6768 (G85/G80 → G52), mt6765 (G80 → G52), mt6762 (P22/P60/G70 → G51/G52), mt6761 (A22 → PowerVR GE8300 — software!), mt6781/6782/6785 (Helio G90/G95 → Mali-G76), mt6797 (Helio X20 → Mali-T880), mt6853 (Helio G80 → Mali-G52), mt6873 (Helio G95), mt6877 (Helio G95), mt6883 (Helio D800 → Mali-G78), mt6885 (D1100 → G78), mt6893 (Dimensity 1200 → G78), mt6895 (D1000), mt6983 (D9000 → Mali-G710).
- Also Unisoc (MT6737, etc.) → PowerVR → software.

Let me rewrite the height functions with a proper SoC table. Also detect the GPU vendor more robustly via Build.HARDWARE / ro.hardware. But on Android 12+, Build.HARDWARE = "qcom" / "mt6769" etc.

Let me write a cleaner implementation:

```java
private static int adrenoHeight(String soc) {
    String s = soc.toLowerCase(Locale.ROOT);
    // Adreno 6xx/7xx recents : 1080p possible
    if (matches(s, "855", "865", "888", "870", "860", "845", "840", "835", "732", "730", "740", "780", "8gen", "8 gen")) return 1080;
    // Adreno 5xx (SD660/SD662/SD665/SD675...) : 720p
    if (matches(s, "660", "662", "665", "675", "680", "685", "690", "632", "636", "630", "508", "506", "405")) return 720;
    return 720;
}
```

And for Mali:
```java
private static int maliHeight(String soc) {
    String s = soc.toLowerCase(Locale.ROOT);
    // Mali-G7x (Helio G90/G95/Dimensity) : 1080p
    if (matches(s, "mt6781","mt6782","mt6785","mt6883","mt6885","mt6893","mt6895","mt6983","dimensity","g95","g90")) return 1080;
    // Mali-G52 (Helio G70/G80/G81, mt6769/mt6768/mt6765/mt6853) : 720p
    if (matches(s, "mt6769","mt6768","mt6765","mt6853","mt6762","g52","g70","g80","g81")) return 720;
    // Mali-G57/G61 : 720p
    ...
    // Mali-T / autres : 540p
    return 540;
}
```

